  "plain": "James Fox, a UFO documentary filmmaker, describes an FBI memo from July 1947 that carries a handwritten note by J. Edgar Hoover, then head of the FBI, the US federal police bureau. As Fox reads it, Hoover wrote that the bureau must insist on full access to recovered discs, and complained that the Army grabbed one and wouldn't let the FBI have it even for a quick look. If true, it would mean the military had a recovered disc in 1947 and kept it from the FBI."
